WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Drag across one sentence in the reader. Or focus the reader and hold Shift while pressing an arrow key. Choose Ask about this, or press Command + Shift + K.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The selection appears above Chat. Choose a connected model, type “Explain this sentence”, and send. Follow any citation back to the source. Without AI, you can still read and practice selecting.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Type a word from the conversation title or preview into Search threads. Select a result to reopen it. This search is within the current document, not all coursework.
